<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank 96 net profit up to 714.90 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank 96 net profit up to 714.90 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   714.90  vs 676.20</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provs	  1,190   vs 1,304</p>
<p>    Group risk provisions		    1,315   vs 833.30</p>
<p>    Own account trading			222.10  vs 192.20</p>
<p>    Net interest income		     4,407.5  vs 4,106.1</p>
<p>    Net commission income		   1,175.6  vs 817.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German banking group is Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG.</p>
</text>
